<header class="qbl-destination-opening qbl-page-width"><span class="qbl-eyebrow">Growing & gathering / The story so far</span><h1>Two gardens.<br><em>Real life in between.</em></h1><p>We have beds back in the city and a growing patch at the cabin. Different places, different problems. A useful plan is a beginning. Keeping things alive, coming back at the right time, and using what grows are the rest of the story.</p><p class="qbl-record-note">Published moments, not a completed planting-to-dinner story. The later results are still to come.</p></header>
<section class="qbl-section qbl-page-width">{{ heading("One / The city beds", "Away for a few days. Then another try.") }}<p class="qbl-section-intro">The city beds dried out while we were away. The terracotta olla project grew out of missed watering. We haven’t published a measured result.</p><div class="qbl-grid qbl-grid--two">{{ card(storyCards['city-beds'],"chapter","01") }}{{ card(storyCards.olla,"chapter","02") }}</div><p class="qbl-record-note">The first photograph shows the April 2026 fresh start; the second shows the olla experiment. We’re still looking for a real photograph of the earlier dry beds.</p></section>
<section class="qbl-notebook-band"><div class="qbl-page-width">{{ heading("Two / Over at the cabin", "One trial row. A few small harvests.") }}<p class="qbl-section-intro">The cabin began with one row in June 2025. There were a few vegetables—and a grape crop we missed while we were away.</p><div class="qbl-grid qbl-grid--three">{{ card(storyCards['first-row'],"chapter","03") }}{{ card(storyCards.grapes,"chapter","04") }}{{ card(storyCards.installed,"chapter","05") }}</div></div></section>
